<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Compliance Security Report — {{ organization.name }}</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --navy:        #0d1b2a;
      --navy-mid:    #1b2d45;
      --blue:        #1565c0;
      --blue-light:  #1e88e5;
      --steel:       #455a64;
      --silver:      #eceff1;
      --white:       #ffffff;
      --critical:    #b71c1c;
      --high:        #e64a19;
      --medium:      #f57c00;
      --low:         #1976d2;
      --info:        #546e7a;
      --pass:        #2e7d32;
      --pass-light:  #e8f5e9;
      --fail:        #c62828;
      --fail-light:  #ffebee;
      --partial:     #f57c00;
      --partial-light:#fff3e0;
      --text:        #212121;
      --text-light:  #546e7a;
      --border:      #cfd8dc;
    }

    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

    body {
      font-family: "Helvetica Neue", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      font-size: 9.5pt;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: var(--text);
      background: var(--white);
    }

    .page {
      width: 210mm;
      min-height: 297mm;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 0;
      page-break-after: always;
      position: relative;
    }

    @page { size: A4; margin: 18mm 16mm 22mm 16mm; }
    @media print {
      .page { width: 100%; page-break-after: always; }
      .no-break { page-break-inside: avoid; }
    }

    /* Cover */
    .cover {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--navy) 0%, #1b3a5c 60%, #0a3060 100%);
      color: var(--white);
      height: 297mm;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 48px 52px;
    }

    .cover-header { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; }

    .cover-logo {
      width: 44px; height: 44px;
      background: var(--white);
      border-radius: 6px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-weight: 900;
      font-size: 18px;
      color: var(--navy);
    }

    .cover-logo-text  { font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; }
    .cover-logo-sub   { font-size: 10px; opacity: 0.6; letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase; }

    .cover-center { flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; padding: 60px 0; }

    .cover-report-type {
      font-size: 9pt; letter-spacing: 3px; text-transform: uppercase; opacity: 0.5; margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .cover-title   { font-size: 32pt; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.15; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .cover-subtitle { font-size: 13pt; font-weight: 300; opacity: 0.7; margin-bottom: 36px; }

    .cover-org {
      font-size: 16pt; font-weight: 600;
      padding: 16px 20px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
      border-left: 4px solid var(--blue-light);
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .cover-framework-badges {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 8px;
      margin-top: 20px;
    }

    .fw-badge {
      padding: 4px 12px;
      border: 1.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3);
      border-radius: 20px;
      font-size: 8.5pt;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85);
    }

    .cover-meta {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 16px;
      margin-top: 40px;
    }

    .cover-meta-item label { display: block; font-size: 7.5pt; letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase; opacity: 0.45; margin-bottom: 3px; }
    .cover-meta-item span  { font-size: 10pt; font-weight: 500; }
    .cover-footer          { opacity: 0.4; font-size: 7.5pt; }

    /* Content pages */
    .content-page { padding: 32px 44px 48px; }

    .page-header {
      display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
      border-bottom: 2px solid var(--navy);
      padding-bottom: 8px; margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .page-header-left, .page-header-right { font-size: 7.5pt; color: var(--text-light); }
    .page-header-right { text-align: right; }

    .page-footer {
      position: absolute;
      bottom: 18px; left: 44px; right: 44px;
      display: flex; justify-content: space-between;
      font-size: 7pt; color: var(--text-light);
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding-top: 6px;
    }

    /* Typography */
    h1 { font-size: 18pt; font-weight: 700; color: var(--navy); margin-bottom: 14px; }
    h2 { font-size: 13pt; font-weight: 700; color: var(--navy); margin: 24px 0 10px; border-left: 4px solid var(--blue); padding-left: 10px; }
    h3 { font-size: 10.5pt; font-weight: 600; color: var(--navy-mid); margin: 16px 0 6px; }
    p  { margin-bottom: 8px; }

    .section-label { font-size: 7.5pt; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--blue); font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; }

    /* Status badges */
    .badge {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 2px 8px;
      border-radius: 3px;
      font-size: 7.5pt;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    }

    .badge-pass    { background: var(--pass);     color: var(--white); }
    .badge-fail    { background: var(--fail);     color: var(--white); }
    .badge-partial { background: var(--partial);  color: var(--white); }
    .badge-critical { background: var(--critical); color: var(--white); }
    .badge-high    { background: var(--high);     color: var(--white); }
    .badge-medium  { background: var(--medium);   color: var(--white); }
    .badge-low     { background: var(--low);       color: var(--white); }
    .badge-info    { background: var(--info);     color: var(--white); }

    /* Summary scorecard */
    .scorecard-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 14px;
      margin: 14px 0 24px;
    }

    .scorecard {
      border: 1.5px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 16px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .scorecard.passing { background: var(--pass-light); border-color: #81c784; }
    .scorecard.partial { background: var(--partial-light); border-color: #ffb74d; }
    .scorecard.failing { background: var(--fail-light); border-color: #ef9a9a; }

    .scorecard-framework { font-size: 9pt; font-weight: 700; color: var(--navy); margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .scorecard-version   { font-size: 7.5pt; color: var(--text-light); }

    .scorecard-score {
      font-size: 28pt;
      font-weight: 800;
      line-height: 1;
      margin: 8px 0 4px;
    }

    .passing .scorecard-score { color: var(--pass); }
    .partial .scorecard-score { color: var(--partial); }
    .failing .scorecard-score { color: var(--fail); }

    .scorecard-progress {
      width: 100%; height: 5px;
      background: var(--border);
      border-radius: 3px;
      overflow: hidden;
      margin: 6px 0 4px;
    }

    .scorecard-bar { height: 100%; border-radius: 3px; }
    .passing .scorecard-bar { background: var(--pass); }
    .partial .scorecard-bar { background: var(--partial); }
    .failing .scorecard-bar { background: var(--fail); }

    .scorecard-counts { font-size: 7.5pt; color: var(--text-light); }

    /* Tables */
    table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      margin: 10px 0 18px;
      font-size: 8.5pt;
    }

    thead tr { background: var(--navy); color: var(--white); }
    thead th { padding: 8px 10px; text-align: left; font-weight: 600; font-size: 8pt; }
    tbody tr:nth-child(even) { background: var(--silver); }
    tbody td { padding: 7px 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); vertical-align: top; }

    /* Requirement rows */
    .req-row-pass    { background: #f1f8e9 !important; }
    .req-row-fail    { background: #ffebee !important; }
    .req-row-partial { background: #fff8e1 !important; }

    .req-id   { font-weight: 700; color: var(--navy); font-family: "Courier New", monospace; font-size: 8pt; }
    .req-desc { font-size: 8pt; color: var(--text-light); margin-top: 2px; }

    /* Evidence links */
    .evidence-tag {
      display: inline-block;
      background: var(--navy);
      color: var(--white);
      padding: 1px 6px;
      border-radius: 3px;
      font-size: 7pt;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin: 1px 2px;
    }

    /* Gap analysis */
    .gap-item {
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 6px;
      padding: 12px 14px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      page-break-inside: avoid;
    }

    .gap-item.critical-gap { border-left: 4px solid var(--critical); background: var(--fail-light); }
    .gap-item.high-gap     { border-left: 4px solid var(--high);     background: #fbe9e7; }
    .gap-item.medium-gap   { border-left: 4px solid var(--medium);   background: var(--partial-light); }

    .gap-header { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 6px; }
    .gap-title  { font-weight: 700; font-size: 10pt; color: var(--navy); }
    .gap-req    { font-size: 7.5pt; color: var(--text-light); margin-top: 2px; font-family: monospace; }
    .gap-body   { font-size: 9pt; color: var(--text); margin-bottom: 6px; }
    .gap-action { font-size: 8.5pt; color: var(--navy-mid); font-weight: 500; }
    .gap-action strong { color: var(--fail); }

    /* Priority table */
    .priority-item {
      display: flex;
      gap: 12px;
      padding: 10px 12px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 5px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      align-items: flex-start;
      page-break-inside: avoid;
    }

    .priority-num {
      width: 26px; height: 26px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--navy);
      color: var(--white);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 10pt;
      font-weight: 800;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .priority-content { flex: 1; }
    .priority-title   { font-weight: 700; font-size: 9.5pt; color: var(--navy); margin-bottom: 3px; }
    .priority-detail  { font-size: 8.5pt; color: var(--steel); }
    .priority-frameworks { font-size: 7.5pt; color: var(--blue); margin-top: 3px; }

    .callout {
      background: #e3f2fd;
      border-left: 4px solid var(--blue);
      padding: 10px 14px;
      border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;
      margin: 12px 0;
      font-size: 9pt;
    }

    .divider { border: none; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); margin: 20px 0; }
    .text-center { text-align: center; }
    .text-right  { text-align: right; }
    .mt-4 { margin-top: 16px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- COVER PAGE -->
<div class="page">
  <div class="cover">
    <div class="cover-header">
      <div class="cover-logo">LC</div>
      <div>
        <div class="cover-logo-text">LegionCyber Shield</div>
        <div class="cover-logo-sub">Security Platform</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="cover-center">
      <div class="cover-report-type">Compliance Security Report</div>
      <div class="cover-title">Regulatory<br>Compliance<br>Assessment</div>
      <div class="cover-subtitle">Gap analysis and audit evidence</div>
      <div class="cover-org">{{ organization.name }}</div>

      <div class="cover-framework-badges">
        {% for fw in frameworks_assessed | default(["PCI-DSS 4.0", "HIPAA", "SOC 2", "ISO 27001", "NIST CSF", "GDPR"]) %}
        <span class="fw-badge">{{ fw }}</span>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>

      <div class="cover-meta">
        <div class="cover-meta-item">
          <label>Report Date</label>
          <span>{{ report.generated_at | strftime("%B %d, %Y") }}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="cover-meta-item">
          <label>Assessment Scope</label>
          <span>{{ scan.target_url | truncate(30) }}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="cover-meta-item">
          <label>Scan Plan</label>
          <span>{{ scan.scan_plan_name }}</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="cover-footer">
      Compliance Report — Confidential — {{ organization.name }} — LegionCyber Shield
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- PAGE 2: COMPLIANCE SCORECARD OVERVIEW -->
<div class="page">
  <div class="content-page">
    <div class="page-header">
      <div class="page-header-left"><strong>{{ organization.name }}</strong> — Compliance Report</div>
      <div class="page-header-right">{{ report.generated_at | strftime("%B %d, %Y") }}</div>
    </div>

    <div class="section-label">Section 01</div>
    <h1>Compliance Scorecard</h1>

    <p>
      This report assesses <strong>{{ organization.name }}</strong>'s web application security posture
      against {{ compliance_results | length if compliance_results is defined else "multiple" }} regulatory
      frameworks. Findings from the {{ scan.scan_plan_name }} scan have been mapped to each framework's
      technical security controls. Scores reflect the percentage of controls where no relevant findings
      were detected.
    </p>

    <div class="callout">
      <strong>Disclaimer:</strong> This automated assessment covers technical security controls that are
      testable via external scanning. Organizational, administrative, and physical controls require
      separate evaluation. This report does not constitute a formal compliance certification.
    </div>

    <!-- Scorecard grid -->
    {% if compliance_results is defined and compliance_results %}
    <div class="scorecard-grid">
      {% for fw in compliance_results %}
        {% set css_class = "passing" if fw.pass_rate >= 80 else ("partial" if fw.pass_rate >= 60 else "failing") %}
      <div class="scorecard {{ css_class }}">
        <div class="scorecard-framework">{{ fw.name }}</div>
        <div class="scorecard-version">v{{ fw.version }}</div>
        <div class="scorecard-score">{{ fw.pass_rate }}%</div>
        <div class="scorecard-progress">
          <div class="scorecard-bar" style="width:{{ fw.pass_rate }}%;"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="scorecard-counts">{{ fw.controls_passed }}/{{ fw.controls_total }} controls</div>
        <div style="margin-top:8px;">
          <span class="badge badge-{% if css_class == 'passing' %}pass{% elif css_class == 'partial' %}medium{% else %}fail{% endif %}">
            {% if css_class == "passing" %}Compliant{% elif css_class == "partial" %}Partial{% else %}Non-Compliant{% endif %}
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>

    <!-- Summary table -->
    <h2>Framework Summary</h2>
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Framework</th>
          <th>Version</th>
          <th>Controls Tested</th>
          <th class="text-center">Pass</th>
          <th class="text-center">Fail</th>
          <th class="text-center">Pass Rate</th>
          <th>Status</th>
          <th>Critical Gaps</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {% for fw in compliance_results %}
        <tr>
          <td><strong>{{ fw.name }}</strong></td>
          <td>{{ fw.version }}</td>
          <td class="text-center">{{ fw.controls_total }}</td>
          <td class="text-center" style="color:var(--pass);font-weight:700;">{{ fw.controls_passed }}</td>
          <td class="text-center" style="color:var(--fail);font-weight:700;">{{ fw.controls_failed }}</td>
          <td class="text-center"><strong>{{ fw.pass_rate }}%</strong></td>
          <td>
            <span class="badge badge-{% if fw.pass_rate >= 80 %}pass{% elif fw.pass_rate >= 60 %}partial{% else %}fail{% endif %}">
              {% if fw.pass_rate >= 80 %}Passing{% elif fw.pass_rate >= 60 %}Partial{% else %}At Risk{% endif %}
            </span>
          </td>
          <td style="color:var(--critical);">{{ fw.critical_gaps | default(0) }}</td>
        </tr>
        {% endfor %}
      </tbody>
    </table>
    {% else %}
    <div class="callout">No compliance frameworks were assessed for this scan. Select a compliance-enabled scan plan to generate this report.</div>
    {% endif %}

    <div class="page-footer">
      <span>LegionCyber Shield — Compliance Report — {{ organization.name }}</span>
      <span>Page 2</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- PAGES 3+: PER-FRAMEWORK DETAIL -->
{% if compliance_results is defined %}
{% for fw in compliance_results %}
<div class="page">
  <div class="content-page">
    <div class="page-header">
      <div class="page-header-left"><strong>{{ organization.name }}</strong> — Compliance Report: {{ fw.name }}</div>
      <div class="page-header-right">{{ report.generated_at | strftime("%B %d, %Y") }}</div>
    </div>

    <div class="section-label">Framework Detail</div>
    <h1>{{ fw.name }} <span style="font-size:14pt;font-weight:400;color:var(--text-light);">v{{ fw.version }}</span></h1>

    <p>{{ fw.description | default("Framework requirements mapped to detected findings.") }}</p>

    <!-- Requirements table -->
    <h2>Requirements Assessment</h2>

    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th style="width:90px;">Req. ID</th>
          <th>Requirement Name</th>
          <th style="width:60px;" class="text-center">Status</th>
          <th style="width:70px;" class="text-center">Severity</th>
          <th>Evidence (Findings)</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {% for req in fw.requirements | default([]) %}
          {% set status = "fail" if req.failing_findings else "pass" %}
          {% set row_class = "req-row-fail" if status == "fail" else "req-row-pass" %}
        <tr class="{{ row_class }}">
          <td>
            <span class="req-id">{{ req.id }}</span>
          </td>
          <td>
            <strong>{{ req.name }}</strong>
            <div class="req-desc">{{ req.description | truncate(100) }}</div>
          </td>
          <td class="text-center">
            <span class="badge badge-{{ 'pass' if status == 'pass' else 'fail' }}">
              {{ "Pass" if status == "pass" else "Fail" }}
            </span>
          </td>
          <td class="text-center">
            {% if req.max_severity %}
            <span class="badge badge-{{ req.max_severity }}">{{ req.max_severity | title }}</span>
            {% else %}
            <span style="color:var(--text-light);">—</span>
            {% endif %}
          </td>
          <td>
            {% if req.failing_findings %}
              {% for f in req.failing_findings[:3] %}
                <span class="evidence-tag">{{ f.name | truncate(25, killwords=True) }}</span>
              {% endfor %}
              {% if req.failing_findings | length > 3 %}
                <span style="font-size:7pt;color:var(--text-light);">+{{ req.failing_findings | length - 3 }} more</span>
              {% endif %}
            {% else %}
              <span style="color:var(--pass);font-size:8pt;">No violations detected</span>
            {% endif %}
          </td>
        </tr>
        {% else %}
        <tr>
          <td colspan="5" class="text-center" style="color:var(--text-light);padding:16px;">
            No requirements data available for this framework.
          </td>
        </tr>
        {% endfor %}
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <div class="page-footer">
      <span>LegionCyber Shield — Compliance Report — {{ organization.name }}</span>
      <span>{{ fw.name }} Detail</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}

<!-- GAP ANALYSIS PAGE -->
<div class="page">
  <div class="content-page">
    <div class="page-header">
      <div class="page-header-left"><strong>{{ organization.name }}</strong> — Compliance Report</div>
      <div class="page-header-right">{{ report.generated_at | strftime("%B %d, %Y") }}</div>
    </div>

    <div class="section-label">Section 02</div>
    <h1>Gap Analysis</h1>

    <p>
      The following gaps represent areas where detected findings indicate non-compliance with one or more
      regulatory framework requirements. Each gap is linked to specific findings and compliance controls.
    </p>

    {% if compliance_gaps is defined and compliance_gaps %}
      {% for gap in compliance_gaps %}
      <div class="gap-item {{ gap.severity | default('medium') }}-gap no-break">
        <div class="gap-header">
          <div>
            <div class="gap-title">{{ gap.title }}</div>
            <div class="gap-req">{{ gap.requirements | join(" · ") if gap.requirements else "" }}</div>
          </div>
          <span class="badge badge-{{ gap.severity | default('medium') }}">{{ gap.severity | default("Medium") | title }}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="gap-body">{{ gap.description }}</div>
        <div class="gap-action">
          <strong>Required action:</strong> {{ gap.remediation_action | default("Review and remediate the linked findings.") }}
        </div>
        {% if gap.affected_frameworks %}
        <div style="margin-top:6px;font-size:7.5pt;color:var(--blue);">
          Frameworks: {{ gap.affected_frameworks | join(", ") }}
        </div>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    {% else %}
      <div class="callout">
        No compliance gaps identified based on current scan results. Continue monitoring with scheduled scans to maintain compliance posture.
      </div>
    {% endif %}

    <hr class="divider" />

    <div class="section-label mt-4">Section 03</div>
    <h1>Remediation Priorities for Compliance</h1>

    <p>Ordered by combined compliance impact and severity. Addressing these items will have the greatest positive effect on your overall compliance posture.</p>

    {% if compliance_remediation_priorities is defined and compliance_remediation_priorities %}
      {% for item in compliance_remediation_priorities %}
      <div class="priority-item no-break">
        <div class="priority-num">{{ loop.index }}</div>
        <div class="priority-content">
          <div class="priority-title">{{ item.title }}</div>
          <div class="priority-detail">{{ item.description }}</div>
          <div class="priority-frameworks">
            Impacts: {{ item.frameworks | join(", ") if item.frameworks else "Multiple frameworks" }}
            {% if item.effort %} &nbsp;|&nbsp; Effort: {{ item.effort }}{% endif %}
          </div>
        </div>
        <span class="badge badge-{{ item.severity | default('medium') }}">{{ item.severity | default('Medium') | title }}</span>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    {% else %}
      <div class="callout">
        No remediation priorities generated — no compliance violations detected. Your current posture meets assessed requirements.
      </div>
    {% endif %}

    <div class="page-footer">
      <span>LegionCyber Shield — Compliance Report — {{ organization.name }}</span>
      <span>Gap Analysis</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- EVIDENCE & METHODOLOGY PAGE -->
<div class="page">
  <div class="content-page">
    <div class="page-header">
      <div class="page-header-left"><strong>{{ organization.name }}</strong> — Compliance Report</div>
      <div class="page-header-right">{{ report.generated_at | strftime("%B %d, %Y") }}</div>
    </div>

    <div class="section-label">Section 04</div>
    <h1>Evidence Summary</h1>

    <p>The following table summarizes findings that directly contributed to compliance failures, grouped by severity.</p>

    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Finding</th>
          <th style="width:70px;" class="text-center">Severity</th>
          <th>Matched URL</th>
          <th>Compliance Frameworks</th>
          <th>Requirements</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {% set compliance_findings = findings.items | selectattr("compliance_frameworks") | list if findings is defined else [] %}
        {% for finding in compliance_findings %}
        <tr>
          <td><strong>{{ finding.name }}</strong></td>
          <td class="text-center">
            <span class="badge badge-{{ finding.severity }}">{{ finding.severity | title }}</span>
          </td>
          <td style="font-size:7.5pt;word-break:break-all;">{{ finding.matched_at | truncate(45) }}</td>
          <td style="font-size:7.5pt;">{{ finding.compliance_frameworks | join(", ") }}</td>
          <td style="font-size:7.5pt;">{{ finding.compliance_requirements | join(", ") if finding.compliance_requirements else "—" }}</td>
        </tr>
        {% else %}
        <tr>
          <td colspan="5" class="text-center" style="color:var(--text-light);padding:16px;">
            No findings with compliance mappings found, or no compliance violations detected.
          </td>
        </tr>
        {% endfor %}
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <hr class="divider" />

    <h2>Methodology & Scope</h2>

    <p>
      Compliance mapping is performed by correlating Nuclei template tags, CWE identifiers, and OWASP
      categories with each framework's technical control requirements. The mapping database is maintained
      by LegionCyber's security research team and updated with each platform release.
    </p>

    <h3>Assessment Limitations</h3>
    <p>
      This automated assessment covers technical security controls verifiable through external web application
      scanning. The following control categories are <strong>out of scope</strong> for automated assessment
      and require manual review:
    </p>

    <ul style="margin-left:20px;font-size:9pt;">
      <li>Administrative and organizational controls (policies, training, vendor management)</li>
      <li>Physical security controls (data center access, device disposal)</li>
      <li>Internal network security (segmentation, internal access controls)</li>
      <li>Personnel controls (background checks, separation of duties)</li>
      <li>Incident response and business continuity procedures</li>
      <li>Audit log review and monitoring procedures</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="callout" style="margin-top:16px;">
      <strong>Next Steps:</strong> To achieve formal compliance certification, engage a Qualified Security Assessor (QSA)
      for PCI-DSS, a HIPAA-experienced auditor for healthcare requirements, or an accredited SOC 2 auditor.
      LegionCyber Shield provides the technical evidence foundation for these engagements.
    </div>

    <div class="page-footer">
      <span>LegionCyber Shield — Compliance Report — {{ organization.name }}</span>
      <span>Evidence &amp; Methodology</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
